### 创建风险评分（ADMIN）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/scores/evaluate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": 1,
  "subjectType": "transaction",
  "subjectId": "TX-20250429-001",
  "score": 85.50,
  "maxScore": 100.00,
  "dimensions": "{\"amount_factor\":30,\"frequency_factor\":25,\"location_factor\":30}",
  "evaluatorId": 1
}

### 评分列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/scores?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 评分详情
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/scores/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 主体最新评分
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/scores/subject/transaction/TX-20250429-001
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
